        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose A Spouse!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Into Your New Home!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Your New Land!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish The Open Seas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Local Game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check Out The Guilds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk To The Locals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have A Night At The Inn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend A Day At the Luxury Beach-Side Spa!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become The Pocket Spouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Your New Home Complete With Beaches, Forests And A Large Castle Market Town In this 8 - 12 Hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quasi-Open Ended Adventure Themed 2D RPG/Life Sim With A Fantasy Twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 33 Boss Encounters and 9 Ambient Enemies, Can You Find Them All?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook, Craft And Farm Your Way Through Day To Day Life And Make A Profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Your Spouse With The Best Gear To Combat Enemies And Wildlife. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk To The Locals, Visit The Shops And Guilds, Seek A Royal Audience, Explore The Deep Woods And Sunny Beaches, Spend A Day At The Spa Or Explore The Harbour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Choice Is Yours In Pocket Spouse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891580/extras/8cdf8bd17bd3ebed88f96940f81af504.avif?t=1789205432\" width=544 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph